{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26411502\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PD自适应DBS的反馈信号与刺激算法，有助于理解STN病理振荡、神经活动状态依赖性及刺激调控机制，为解释STN信号与FOG的关系提供重要背景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26413237\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要综述PD整体姿势平衡障碍，FOG仅作为平衡受损因素之一，未涉及STN神经活动或FOG特异性神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26429349\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"提供腰部加速度计客观检测FOG的方法学证据，有助于理解FOG行为事件的量化和识别差异，作为STN神经活动与FOG关联研究的结局测量依据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26433913\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究步态启动时预期性姿势调整的IMU测量方法，未直接评估FOG或STN神经活动，与目标问题仅有间接联系。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26443998\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"主要研究PD患者跌倒风险的预测因素，FOG并非核心研究对象，也没有STN神经活动或DBS证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26454703\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究不同诱发任务下FOG的发生及加速度计检测性能，揭示转身和快速短步等任务对FOG识别的影响，可帮助解释STN-FOG研究中的行为任务及测量异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26469737\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"在帕金森病非人灵长类模型中直接记录STN和GP的LFP，揭示beta活动的运动任务依赖性及个体间变异，为区分FOG特异性神经活动与一般运动相关活动提供基础证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26469868\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究外周机械刺激对PD静息态功能连接的影响，未涉及FOG，也未提供STN特异性神经活动证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26483133\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述白质病变与PD冻结步态及轴性运动症状的关系，提供可能独立于STN异常活动的血管性和结构性竞争机制，有助于解释FOG的临床异质性。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26487844\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"题目涉及Nogo-A与PD，但缺少摘要，且现有信息未显示其与STN神经活动或FOG存在直接关联。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26497023\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"系统综述中脑步行区、脑桥被盖及网状脊髓系统对步态和姿势的调控，为STN之外的脑干运动网络提供竞争性机制框架，有助于解释FOG的多网络起源。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26499867\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"属于研究认知功能和运动训练效果关系的随机交叉试验方案，尚无研究结果，也未直接研究STN活动或FOG机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26509113\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接研究STN电极植入微损伤效应及STN-DBS引起的脑网络变化，发现脑干与运动前区连接改变，为区分STN刺激直接效应和脑干网络介导效应提供重要机制证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26580556\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较PD伴与不伴FOG患者的上肢冻结现象，发现上肢冻结与FOG发生及严重程度相关，为共同幅度控制障碍等非STN特异性竞争机制提供证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26594627\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接记录PD患者STN-LFP并发现beta活动随不同抓握任务发生不同程度的去同步化，有助于区分FOG相关STN活动与一般运动准备、执行及皮质-STN网络调节。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26597124\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述PPN的gamma活动及其对姿势、步态和觉醒的调控，并涉及PPN-DBS，为比较STN与脑干步行网络在PD步态障碍中的作用提供重要替代机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26605103\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者长期社区步态参数与认知功能的相关性，未直接分析FOG或STN神经活动，不能有效回答目标问题。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26606871\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者长期跌倒风险轨迹，FOG仅作为风险评估指标之一，没有分析STN神经活动或FOG的神经机制。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26617566\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"综述直接涉及PD冻结步态及听觉节律、多感觉线索对步态的影响，并讨论相关神经网络和时间处理机制，可用于提出外部线索调节异常基底节-运动网络的竞争性解释。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26630325\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究PD患者步态启动时预期性姿势调整的变异性，虽然涉及启动困难和姿势-运动耦合，但未直接测量FOG或STN活动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26631477\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"研究大鼠STN中GluN2D型NMDA受体的基础突触生理及神经元兴奋性，未涉及PD、FOG或相关行为表型，距离研究问题过远。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26632286\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅提供Poster Session会议摘要集标题，没有具体研究内容，无法提取与STN神经活动或FOG相关的证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26632288\",\n      \"decision\": \"exclude\",\n      \"reason\": \"仅提供Poster Session会议摘要集标题，没有具体研究内容，无法提取与STN神经活动或FOG相关的证据。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26635194\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"专门综述帕金森综合征FOG的异质性及药物治疗反应，可为区分多巴胺反应性与非反应性FOG、解释药物状态对STN-FOG关系的影响提供临床背景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"pid\": \"PMID:26639981\",\n      \"decision\": \"include\",\n      \"reason\": \"直接比较伴与不伴FOG的PD患者的小脑依赖性步态适应能力，发现FOG患者适应后效应减弱，为小脑功能障碍这一非STN中心性竞争机制提供直接证据。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "280bafbe-d0d6-4694-9142-d54d8a7c9496", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T152414867223Z", "elapsed_seconds": 157.625, "completed_utc": "2026-11-13T15:26:52.498382+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5dc267e62a6dde0550bfaf3cdc31bd100d4c25e1f01b19599507eaa417cd8c0f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261113T152414867223Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5e4147d34e505499f05e2641e86cdb1dcc1745dd6b9380fe9791d2a937b8becd"}}}
